---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="進階資源 - 台灣教育處方籤"
  description="線上課程、開放教育資源、國內外競賽、主題書單四個資源專頁，以及程式練功平台與科普頻道。"
  keywords="進階資源, 線上課程, 開放教育資源, 競賽, 書單, 程式練功, 科普頻道, 自主學習"
  currentSection="advanced-resources"
  bodyClass="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">
          進階<span class="gradient-text-advanced">資源</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 md:gap-4">
          <a href="#resource-pages" class="bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-purple-200 transition">四個資源專頁</a>
          <a href="#coding-practice" class="bg-pink-100 text-pink-800 font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-pink-200 transition">程式練功平台</a>
          <a href="#science-channels" class="bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-sky-200 transition">推薦科普頻道</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-12 space-y-20">
      <!-- 四個資源專頁 -->
      <section id="resource-pages">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">四個資源專頁</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <a href="online-courses.html" class="resource-card block bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-800">線上課程精選</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Coursera、edX、Khan Academy 等平台的課程，可依學科領域、課程平台與授課語言篩選。</p>
            <span class="text-purple-600 font-semibold">前往探索 &rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a href="open-education.html" class="resource-card block bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-800">開放教育資源</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">AI 實驗室官方資源、開放科學計畫、開放課程平台與國際科學社群公開的學習資源。</p>
            <span class="text-purple-600 font-semibold">前往探索 &rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a href="competitions.html" class="resource-card block bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-800">國內外競賽資訊</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">科學、數理、資訊到藝術設計的競賽，可依競賽地區、級別與參賽形式篩選。</p>
            <span class="text-purple-600 font-semibold">前往探索 &rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a href="reading-list.html" class="resource-card block bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-800">主題書單推薦</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">12 個主題的書單，每本附作者、推薦理由和標籤。</p>
            <span class="text-purple-600 font-semibold">前往探索 &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 程式練功平台 -->
      <section id="coding-practice">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">程式練功平台</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <a href="https://www.freecodecamp.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">freeCodeCamp</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">免費的程式學習網站，課程從網頁開發到數據分析，完成實作專案可以拿到認證。</p>
            <span class="sr-only">（另開新分頁）</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.codewars.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Codewars</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">以「武術」為主題的解題平台，透過解決各種難度的「Kata」程式挑戰來逐步提升等級。</p>
            <span class="sr-only">（另開新分頁）</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://leetcode.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">LeetCode</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">演算法與資料結構的題庫，常被拿來準備科技公司的程式面試。</p>
            <span class="sr-only">（另開新分頁）</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 推薦科普頻道 -->
      <section id="science-channels">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">推薦科普頻道</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/inanutshell" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Kurzgesagt</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">用動畫解釋宇宙、物理、生物等科學議題。</p>
            <span class="sr-only">（另開新分頁）</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/veritasium" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Veritasium（真理元素）</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">透過有趣的實驗與訪談破解科學迷思，並深入探討科學背後的原理與故事。</p>
            <span class="sr-only">（另開新分頁）</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/3blue1brown" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">3Blue1Brown</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">用動畫講解微積分、線性代數等數學概念。</p>
            <span class="sr-only">（另開新分頁）</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <style is:global>
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    }
    .gradient-text-advanced {
      background: -webkit-linear-gradient(45deg, #7c3aed, #be185d);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    /* 列印不印背景，和 global.css 的 .gradient-text 一樣改回實色。 */
    @media print {
      .gradient-text-advanced { -webkit-text-fill-color: currentColor; background: none; }
    }
    .resource-card {
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }
    .resource-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
